Task: Benchmark StatsSystem update loop and validate no allocations.
Summary: Optimized StatsSystem by replacing heap-allocating std::map with stack-based std::array in the hot path. Added a performance benchmark suite.
Files:
- src/systems/StatsSystem.cpp
- tests/StatsBenchmark.cpp
- tests/CMakeLists.txt
Why: To meet high-performance requirements (10,000+ entities) and ensure zero allocations in the game loop.
Result: 10x performance improvement (2.8ms -> 0.26ms for 10k entities).
